<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CC-Amatil extends losses at opening.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CC-Amatil extends losses at opening.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in beverage group Coca-Cola Amatil extended Monday's fall at the opening on Tuesday, as investors sold down the stock following a profit warnings about the calendar 1996 year.</p>
</text>
